{"path":"services.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Services — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Membership-based integrative care and personalized planning in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.">
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fbf7f2;--muted:#6b5b4a;--accent:#7b8a52;--accent-2:#a67c52;--card:#fff6ef;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6)}
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Noto Sans',sans-serif;color:var(--muted);background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#fff);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:18px 28px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(123,138,82,0.06),rgba(166,124,82,0.03));border-bottom:1px solid rgba(107,91,74,0.06)}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-weight:700}
    nav a{margin-left:16px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
    .container{max-width:980px;margin:28px auto;padding:0 20px}
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:22px;align-items:start}
    .hero-card{background:var(--card);padding:20px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(101,84,66,0.06)}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#3f362e;font-size:1.6rem}
    p.lead{margin:0;color:#564a40}
    .muted{color:#7e6e60;font-size:0.95rem}
    .services-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:16px}
    .service{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.9),rgba(255,255,242,0.9));border:1px solid rgba(167,124,82,0.08)}
    .service h3{margin:0 0 6px 0;font-size:1rem;color:#3f362e}
    .service p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:0.92rem}
    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:14px;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}
    /* Planner & Inventory */
    .widget{background:#fff;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(107,91,74,0.06);margin-top:12px}
    label{display:block;font-size:0.9rem;margin:8px 0;color:#4b4036}
    .checkbox-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:6px}
    input[type="checkbox"]{margin-right:8px}
    .row{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}
    .btn{padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;border:0;background:var(--accent-2);color:#fff;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
    textarea{width:100%;height:160px;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(107,91,74,0.06);resize:vertical}
    footer{margin:40px 0 80px 0;color:#8b7a6a;font-size:0.9rem}
    /* small screens */
    @media (max-width:860px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}.services-list{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo">HM</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Begin</a>
      <a href="services.html" aria-current="page">Offerings</a>
      <a href="conditions.html">Conditions</a>
      <a href="approach.html">Philosophy</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Membership</a>
      <a href="book.html">Book</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <div class="hero">
      <section class="hero-card">
        <h1>Membership care and guided sessions</h1>
        <p class="lead">A membership model that pairs regular clinical guidance with practical, daily adjustments. Choose a rhythm that fits your week and build a personalized cadence below.</p>
        <div class="services-list">
          <div class="service">
            <h3>Compass Intake</h3>
            <p>Foundational 60–75 min intake to orient priorities, tests, and immediate support.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="service">
            <h3>Guided Follow-ups</h3>
            <p>30–45 min session to refine plan, interpret labs, and reinforce skills.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="service">
            <h3>Group Learning Circles</h3>
            <p>Small cohort sessions to share practical routines, recipes, and movement practices.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="service">
            <h3>Member Toolkit</h3>
            <p>Actionable guides, habit trackers, and check-ins between visits.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a class="cta" href="pricing.html">Explore membership options</a>
      </section>

      <aside>
        <div class="hero-card">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0">Session Planner</h3>
          <p class="muted">Draft a plan now — export a plain-text summary to bring to your first visit.</p>
          <div class="widget" id="planner">
            <label>Primary focus</label>
            <select id="focus" style="width:100%;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(107,91,74,0.06)">
              <option value="Energy & Sleep">Energy & Sleep</option>
              <option value="Stress regulation">Stress regulation</option>
              <option value="Digestion">Digestion</option>
              <option value="Chronic pain">Chronic pain</option>
              <option value="Metabolic health">Metabolic health</option>
              <option value="Women’s health">Women’s health</option>
            </select>

            <label style="margin-top:8px">Preferred touchpoints</label>
            <div class="row" style="justify-content:space-between">
              <div>
                <input type="radio" name="cadence" id="cad1" value="Weekly"> <label for="cad1">Weekly</label>
                <input type="radio" name="cadence" id="cad2" value="Biweekly" checked> <label for="cad2">Biweekly</label>
                <input type="radio" name="cadence" id="cad3" value="Monthly"> <label for="cad3">Monthly</label>
              </div>
            </div>

            <label style="margin-top:8px">Session types to include</label>
            <div class="checkbox-grid">
              <label><input type="checkbox" value="Intake" class="stype"> Intake</label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" value="Short follow-up" class="stype"> Short follow-up</label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" value="Nutrition review" class="stype"> Nutrition review</label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" value="Movement plan" class="stype"> Movement plan</label>
            </div>

            <label style="margin-top:8px">Intensity (how much change do you want in first 3 months?)</label>
            <input type="range" id="intensity" min="1" max="10" value="5">
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
              <button class="btn" id="build">Build plan</button>
              <button class="btn" id="clear" style="background:#d6c1b0;color:#3f362e">Reset</button>
            </div>

            <label style="margin-top:12px">Plan summary (plain text)</label>
            <textarea id="planOut" placeholder="Your plan will appear here..."></textarea>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px;justify-content:flex-end">
              <button class="btn" id="copyPlan">Copy</button>
              <a class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" style="background:var(--accent);text-decoration:none">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-card" style="margin-top:12px">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0">Whole-person inventory</h3>
          <p class="muted">Select areas you'd like to address. We'll generate a focused consultation agenda and recommended follow-up cadence.</p>
          <div class="widget">
            <div class="checkbox-grid" id="areas">
              <label><input type="checkbox" value="Sleep"> Sleep</label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" value="Stress"> Stress/Breathing</label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" value="Digestion"> Digestion</label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" value="Movement"> Movement</label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" value="Mood"> Mood & Emotion</label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" value="Energy"> Energy/Fatigue</label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" value="Environment"> Home & Work Environment</label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" value="Relationships"> Relationships</label>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px">
              <button class="btn" id="agendaBtn">Generate agenda</button>
              <button class="btn" id="agendaCopy" style="background:#d6c1b0;color:#3f362e">Copy agenda</button>
            </div>
            <label style="margin-top:10px">Consultation agenda</label>
            <textarea id="agendaOut" placeholder="Your consultation agenda and follow-up cadence"></textarea>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <section style="margin-top:18px" class="hero-card">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0">Membership framing</h3>
      <p class="muted">We organize support as a membership to prioritize continuity. Memberships include a baseline intake, scheduled follow-ups, asynchronous check-ins, and learning circles. Pricing and exact components are transparent on the membership page.</p>
    </section>

    <footer>
      <div>Phone: {{PHONE}} • Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
      <div style="margin-top:8px">Located in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} — educational services and non-urgent clinical support. Not a substitute for emergency care.</div>
    </footer>
  </main>

  <script>
    // Session Planner logic
    function collectSessionPlan(){
      const focus = document.getElementById('focus').value;
      const cadence = document.querySelector('input[name="cadence"]:checked').value;
      const intensity = document.getElementById('intensity').value;
      const types = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.stype:checked')).map(n=>n.value);
      const severity = (intensity <=3)?'low':(intensity<=7)?'moderate':'high';
      const planLines = [];
      planLines.push('{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Session Planner');
      planLines.push('Primary focus: '+focus);
      planLines.push('Preferred cadence: '+cadence);
      planLines.push('Intensity (3-mo target): '+severity+' (score:'+intensity+')');
      planLines.push('Included session types: '+(types.length?types.join(', '):'Standard follow-up'));
      planLines.push('Suggested first steps:\n- Intake or focused follow-up to clarify goals\n- Baseline labs or tracking as indicated\n- Small, measurable habit to start in week 1');
      planLines.push('Suggested touchpoints: '+cadence+' sessions with asynchronous check-ins between visits.');
      planLines.push('\nBring this summary to your first visit or paste it in the member intake form.');
      return planLines.join('\n');
    }
    document.getElementById('build').addEventListener('click',function(){
      document.getElementById('planOut').value = collectSessionPlan();
    });
    document.getElementById('clear').addEventListener('click',function(){
      document.getElementById('planOut').value='';
      document.getElementById('intensity').value=5;
      document.querySelector('#cad2').checked = true;
      document.querySelectorAll('.stype').forEach(i=>i.checked=false);
      document.getElementById('focus').value='Energy & Sleep';
    });
    document.getElementById('copyPlan').addEventListener('click',function(){
      const t = document.getElementById('planOut');
      t.select();navigator.clipboard.writeText(t.value).then(()=>{alert('Plan copied to clipboard')}).catch(()=>{alert('Copy failed — select and copy manually')});
    });

    // Inventory -> agenda logic
    function buildAgenda(){
      const checked = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('#areas input:checked')).map(i=>i.value);
      if(!checked.length){
        return 'No areas selected. Consider selecting 2–4 priorities to focus on during the first visit.';
      }
      const agenda = [];
      agenda.push('Consultation agenda — selected areas: '+checked.join(', '));
      agenda.push('\n1) Arrival map (10 min): patient story & priority ranking');
      agenda.push('2) Focused review (20–30 min): go deeper into top 2 areas from the list');
      agenda.push('3) Practical targets (10 min): 1–2 actionable steps for week 1');
      agenda.push('4) Testing & resources (5–10 min): suggested labs or trackers if indicated');
      agenda.push('5) Follow-up plan: '+(checked.length>4?'Biweekly recommended for the first 6–8 weeks':'Monthly, unless symptom intensity suggests sooner'));
      agenda.push('\nFollow-up cadence guidance:');
      agenda.push('- Low complexity: 4–6 week check-in cadence');
      agenda.push('- Moderate complexity or multiple interacting concerns: 2–3 week cadence initially');
      agenda.push('- High complexity or medication adjustments: 1–2 week check-ins and closer asynchronous contact');
      agenda.push('\nBring symptom logs, recent labs, and any current medications.');
      return agenda.join('\n');
    }
    document.getElementById('agendaBtn').addEventListener('click',function(){
      document.getElementById('agendaOut').value = buildAgenda();
    });
    document.getElementById('agendaCopy').addEventListener('click',function(){
      const t = document.getElementById('agendaOut');navigator.clipboard.writeText(t.value).then(()=>{alert('Agenda copied')}).catch(()=>{alert('Copy failed')});
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"conditions.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Conditions & Support — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Educational and supportive approaches for common chronic conditions. Not a substitute for emergency medical care.">
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fffaf6;--ink:#483b33;--accent:#846e4b;--panel:#fff6ef}
    body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:var(--bg)}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:16px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(72,59,51,0.06)}
    .logo{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8f7b56,#b07b51);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700}
    nav a{margin-left:14px;color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none}
    .wrap{max-width:980px;margin:28px auto;padding:0 20px}
    h1{font-size:1.5rem;margin:0 0 6px 0}
    .lead{color:#6e5f52}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:18px;margin-top:16px}
    .card{background:var(--panel);padding:16px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(132,110,75,0.06)}
    ul.conditions{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}
    ul.conditions li{padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed rgba(72,59,51,0.04)}
    .muted{color:#7b6a5b}
    .disclaimer{background:#fff3e9;padding:12px;border-left:4px solid #d9b79b;border-radius:6px;color:#6d5144;margin-bottom:12px}
    .btn{display:inline-block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}
    textarea{width:100%;height:140px;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(72,59,51,0.06);resize:vertical}
    @media (max-width:860px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center">
      <div class="logo">HM</div>
      <div>
        <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong>
        <div style="font-size:0.85rem;color:#6e5f52">Clinical + integrative membership care</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="services.html">Services</a>
      <a href="conditions.html" aria-current="page">Support Areas</a>
      <a href="approach.html">Our way</a>
      <a href="book.html">Book</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="wrap">
    <h1>Conditions we support — educational and supportive care</h1>
    <p class="lead">We provide evidence-aware, integrative approaches to a range of chronic and recurring concerns. Our work is educational and supportive — we do not claim cures. Decisions about medications and urgent care should be made with your primary medical provider.</p>

    <div class="disclaimer">
      <strong>Important:</strong> The information here is not medical advice. If you experience severe or life-threatening symptoms (chest pain, sudden weakness, trouble breathing, thoughts of harming yourself), call emergency services or your local emergency department immediately.
    </div>

    <div class="grid">
      <section>
        <div class="card">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0">Common concerns we work with</h3>
          <ul class="conditions">
            <li><strong>Sleep & Fatigue</strong> — assessment of sleep patterns, behavioral supports, and targeted interventions.</li>
            <li><strong>Digestive irregularities</strong> — symptom tracking, food patterns, and stepwise testing when needed.</li>
            <li><strong>Chronic pain</strong> — pacing, movement therapies, and layered strategies to reduce flare frequency.</li>
            <li><strong>Stress, anxiety, and mood challenges</strong> — tools for regulation, lifestyle changes, and coordinated care with prescribers when appropriate.</li>
            <li><strong>Metabolic concerns</strong> — practical habit shifts, nutrition focus, and monitoring strategies.</li>
            <li><strong>Hormone-related concerns</strong> — cycle health, peri-menopause support, and individualized tracking.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:12px">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0">How we approach complex or overlapping issues</h3>
          <p class="muted">We prioritize clarifying which concern most limits your day-to-day. From there, we sequence steps that reduce burden quickly while building toward longer-term resilience. This includes practical tracking, selective testing, and short focused check-ins.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:12px">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0">When to bring documentation</h3>
          <p class="muted">Bring recent labs, medication lists, symptom logs, and any notes from other clinicians. That makes the first session more productive.</p>
          <a class="btn" href="book.html">Prepare for your visit</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <aside>
        <div class="card">
          <h4 style="margin-top:0">Quick inventory — identify priorities</h4>
          <p class="muted">Select items below and generate a short agenda you can paste into your booking note or share with your clinician.</p>
          <div style="margin-top:8px">
            <label><input type="checkbox" value="Sleep"> Trouble falling/staying asleep</label><br>
            <label><input type="checkbox" value="Pain"> Chronic aches or pain</label><br>
            <label><input type="checkbox" value="Digestive"> Bloating/irregular bowel habits</label><br>
            <label><input type="checkbox" value="Stress"> Stress or overwhelm</label><br>
            <label><input type="checkbox" value="Energy"> Low energy during day</label><br>
            <label><input type="checkbox" value="Hormones"> Cycle or hormone changes</label>
          </div>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px">
            <button class="btn" id="condGen">Create note</button>
            <button class="btn" id="condCopy" style="background:#d6c1b0;color:#3f362e">Copy</button>
          </div>
          <label style="margin-top:10px">Note for booking</label>
          <textarea id="condOut" placeholder="Generated consultation note"></textarea>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:12px">
          <h4 style="margin-top:0">Care boundaries & referral</h4>
          <p class="muted">If your needs fall outside our scope (urgent medical issues, complex medication management requiring frequent adjustments), we work with your primary clinician and local specialists to coordinate safe care and referrals.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:12px">
          <h4 style="margin-top:0">Questions?</h4>
          <p class="muted">Call {{PHONE}} or email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a>. We can clarify whether membership support fits your current needs.</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <section style="margin-top:18px" class="card">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0">Support phrasing we use with members</h3>
      <p class="muted">Our conversations focus on what to try first, how to measure progress, and when to escalate care. We avoid promises of cures and emphasize practical, low-burden steps with measurable outcomes.</p>
    </section>

    <footer style="margin-top:20px;color:#7b6a5b">Note: This page is educational. For personalized medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment, consult with your primary health care provider. If you are in {{STATE}} and require immediate help, contact local emergency services.</footer>
  </main>

  <script>
    function genCondNote(){
      const boxes = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('aside .card input[type=checkbox]'));
      const picked = boxes.filter(b=>b.checked).map(b=>b.value);
      if(!picked.length) return 'No priorities selected.';
      const lines = [];
      lines.push('Patient note for booking — priorities: ' + picked.join(', '));
      lines.push('\nBrief history to bring: recent labs, current medications, symptom duration, and any sleep/diet logs.');
      lines.push('\nSuggested first visit goals:');
      picked.forEach((p,i)=>{
        lines.push((i+1)+') Focus on '+p+' — identify 1 actionable change and a simple tracking metric.');
      });
      lines.push('\nRecommended follow-up cadence: '+(picked.length>3?'Biweekly initially':'Monthly, with option to increase cadence if needed'));
      return lines.join('\n');
    }
    document.getElementById('condGen').addEventListener('click',function(){document.getElementById('condOut').value = genCondNote();});
    document.getElementById('condCopy').addEventListener('click',function(){navigator.clipboard.writeText(document.getElementById('condOut').value).then(()=>alert('Copied')).catch(()=>alert('Copy failed'))});
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"approach.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Our Approach — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="An integrative, evidence-aware clinical workflow organized around membership continuity in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.">
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fbf7f0;--text:#463a32;--accent:#7c8f5a;--gold:#c79a6b}
    body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text)}
    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:14px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(70,58,50,0.06)}
    nav a{margin-left:12px;color:var(--text);text-decoration:none}
    .wrap{max-width:980px;margin:28px auto;padding:0 20px}
    .lead{color:#6d5f53}
    .columns{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:18px}
    .card{background:white;padding:16px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(70,58,50,0.06)}
    .steps{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    .step{padding:12px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(124,143,90,0.06),transparent);border:1px solid rgba(124,143,90,0.06)}
    .muted{color:#7b6d61}
    .btn{display:inline-block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}
    textarea{width:100%;height:120px;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(70,58,50,0.06);resize:vertical}
    @media (max-width:860px){.columns{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center">
      <div style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7c8f5a,#c79a6b);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700">HM</div>
      <div>
        <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong>
        <div style="font-size:0.85rem;color:#6d5f53">Membership-supported integrative care</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Start</a>
      <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
      <a href="approach.html" aria-current="page">Method</a>
      <a href="conditions.html">Support</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Join</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Reach us</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="wrap">
    <h1>How we work — layered, measurable, humane</h1>
    <p class="lead">Our clinical path is organized around practical gains: what can be tested and changed in the near term, and what grows resilience over months. Membership ensures continuity so we can tune steadily rather than rush fixes.</p>

    <div class="columns" style="margin-top:16px">
      <section>
        <div class="card">
